<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kenneth Cole cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kenneth Cole cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Friday it downgraded  Kenneth Cole Productions Inc to neutral from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Earlier, Kenneth Cole reported second quarter earnings fell to  $0.06 per share from $0.20 a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Thursday at 15-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
